    "long_instructions": "#Milestone Four: Final Polish and Improvements\r\n\r\n**Goal:** Test, present, and reflect on your app’s usability, ethics, and AI accountability, identifying strengths and future improvements.\r\n\r\n1.  **Define Personas:** Ask an AI: *\"Generate 2 user personas for my app. What specific UI problems might they face?\"*\r\n2.  **Update for Users:** Make an update directly related to what issues these personas might uncover. What small improvements might be made in order to increase these users' experiences with your app?\r\n5.  **Test:** Work with AI to do a final testing pass on your app, ensuring that it works in all conditions.",
